  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n ( { 8.5 - 2(1)/(2) } )of 16.5 - [ { 27.4 - left{ {10(1)/(4) of 2.5 - ( { 1(1)/(2) - 1(1)/(5) } ) } right} } ]\n\n⇒ (8.5 – 5/2) of 16.5 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (3/2 – 6/5)}]\n\n⇒ (17 – 5)/2 of 16.5 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (3/2 – 6/5)}]\n\n⇒ 12/2 of 16.5 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (3/2 – 6/5)}]\n\n⇒ 6 of 16.5 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (3/2 – 6/5)}]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (3/2 – 6/5)}]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – (15 – 12)/10}]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – {41/4 of 2.5 – 3/10}]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – (41/4 × 2.5 – 3/10)]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – (102.5/4 – 3/10)]\n\n⇒ 99 – [27.4 – (512.5 – 6)/20] \n\n⇒ 99 – (27.4 – 506.5/20)\n\n⇒ 99 – (27.4 – 25.325)\n\n⇒ 99 – 2.075\n\n⇒ 96.925\n\n**∴ The required value is 96.925**",
